			"Message": "docs(Sky): Add spacing emoji between component names in README\n\nInsert Unicode EM QUAD character (&#x2001;) between \"Sky\" and the galaxy emoji, and between \"Land\" and the landscape emoji in the README header table. This provides consistent visual separation between component identifiers and their decorative emoji marks in the rendered markdown.\n\nThe change improves readability of the component listing without altering semantic content.",
